COPY public.warnings (id, user_email, user_name, letter, actions_context, issued_by_email, issued_by_name, emailed, created_at) FROM stdin;
6	zainjamil611@gmail.com	Zain	US GROUP  \n[Company Address]  \n[City, Pakistan]  \n\nJuly 30, 2026  \n\nTo: Zain  \n\nSubject: Official Written Warning – Improper Use of Internal Analytics Dashboard  \n\nDear Zain,\n\nThis letter serves as a formal written warning concerning your recent activity on the company’s internal analytics dashboard. Our records indicate that, during the morning hours of July 30, 2026, you accessed the system and performed actions that fall outside the scope of your authorized responsibilities.\n\nSpecifically, you generated a custom PDF report containing multiple data items and posed a query requesting a comparative analysis of the top five customers by order volume. Both activities involve the extraction and handling of sensitive business information without prior approval from the relevant supervisory or data‑governance authorities.\n\nThe unauthorized extraction and analysis of customer data is a breach of US GROUP’s data‑security and confidentiality policies. Such conduct jeopardizes the integrity of our proprietary information, may compromise competitive advantage, and could expose the company to regulatory and reputational risk.\n\nYou are required to cease any further unauthorized reporting or data‑query activities immediately. All future requests for custom reports or detailed customer analyses must be submitted through the appropriate approval channels and performed only by personnel who have been expressly granted permission.\n\nPlease be advised that any recurrence of similar violations may result in further disciplinary measures, up to and including more severe employer‑initiated action.\n\nWe trust that you will adhere to the company’s policies moving forward. Should you require clarification regarding permissible use of the analytics platform, please contact the HR department.\n\nSincerely,\n\nAdmin  \nHuman Resources Department  \nUS GROUP	[{"action": "login", "details": "Logged in", "created_at": "2026-07-30T07:18:54.299122"}, {"action": "custom_report", "details": "Generated a custom PDF report (3 items)", "created_at": "2026-07-30T06:37:24.642914"}, {"action": "chat", "details": "Asked: Compare top 5 customers with number of orders", "created_at": "2026-07-30T06:36:48.180112"}]	admin	Admin	f	2026-07-30 07:45:01.02781
7	zainjamil611@gmail.com	Zain	US GROUP  \n\nJuly 30, 2026  \n\nTo: Zain  \n\nSubject: Formal Warning Regarding Improper Use of Internal Analytics Dashboard  \n\nDear Zain,\n\nIt has come to the attention of management that, on July 30, 2026, you performed two activities on the company’s internal analytics dashboard that are not consistent with our data handling policies. Specifically, you generated a customized PDF report containing multiple data items, and you subsequently requested a comparative analysis of the top five customers and their order volumes.\n\nThe creation and extraction of customized reports, as well as the solicitation of detailed customer performance data, are actions that must be authorized and limited to personnel with a demonstrable business need. Unrestricted dissemination of such information can compromise the confidentiality of our client relationships, affect competitive positioning, and violate internal controls governing the use of proprietary data.\n\nPlease be advised that this conduct is unacceptable and must cease immediately. You are required to refrain from generating custom reports or requesting detailed customer analytics without prior approval from your supervisor or the data governance team.\n\nAny further violation of the company’s data usage policies may result in additional corrective measures, up to and including formal disciplinary action.\n\nWe trust that you will adhere to the established guidelines moving forward. Should you have any questions regarding permissible use of the analytics platform, please contact the HR department.\n\nSincerely,\n\nAdmin  \nHuman Resources Department  \nUS GROUP	[{"action": "custom_report", "details": "Generated a custom PDF report (3 items)", "created_at": "2026-07-30T06:37:24.642914"}, {"action": "chat", "details": "Asked: Compare top 5 customers with number of orders", "created_at": "2026-07-30T06:36:48.180112"}]	admin	Admin	t	2026-07-30 11:51:01.480584
